    "The official site identifies the campus as RAJ RISHI COLLEGE, ALWAR and gives the address Near Nehru Park, Alwar, Rajasthan 301001, matching the R.R. College, Alwar institution context.",
    "The official Academics > Courses page contains only the placeholder text \"Courses\". The 12 programme names were therefore taken from the official homepage Education Programs cards, with the current 2026 admissions page used to corroborate the undergraduate groups.",
    "The official Skill Development Courses page lists only generic categories and no named active degree, diploma, or certificate programme. A Japanese and Spanish language-learning notice was treated as a notification rather than a catalogue programme and excluded.",
    "The homepage states that the website is under migration, so the official programme catalogue is incomplete and requires manual review.",
